{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_010_modos_local_remoto_man_auto_bumpless", "label": "ADR-010 \u2014 Modos LOCAL/REMOTO e MAN/AUTO com transfer\u00eancia bumpless", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-010-modos-local-remoto-man-auto-bumpless.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_010_modos_local_remoto_man_auto_bumpless_modos_bumpless", "label": "Modos LOCAL/REMOTO + MAN/AUTO com bumpless", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-010-modos-local-remoto-man-auto-bumpless.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dois eixos: LOCAL (PID no PLC controla) / REMOTO (MPC assume), com troca bumpless nos dois sentidos escrevendo vari\u00e1veis de modo do PID (AUTO \u2194 RCAS/CAS/ROUT, configur\u00e1vel por MV); MAN/AUTO \u00e9 sub-modo de REMOTO (MAN: operador escreve MV pela UI; AUTO: MPC calcula). Bumpless exige tracking da MV real do PLC via tag de readback por MV em LOCAL. Alinhado \u00e0 shed hierarchy PID\u2194APC da pr\u00e1tica industrial."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_010_modos_local_remoto_man_auto_bumpless", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_010_modos_local_remoto_man_auto_bumpless_modos_bumpless", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-010-modos-local-remoto-man-auto-bumpless.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_010_modos_local_remoto_man_auto_bumpless", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_015_papeis_admin_operador", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-010-modos-local-remoto-man-auto-bumpless.md